        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 12 Inch \"C\" Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis sleek 12\" high pull is great for  entry doors, shower doors, commercial doors, storefront doors, almost any door. They are available as back to back, surface or thru-bolt mounting.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nImpeccably crafted from high grade 3/8\" thick non rusting aluminum in your choice of 3 high quality, long lasting finish choices.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/c-pull-size.jpg?v=1704442266\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions C door pulls dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis \"C\" Door Pull is available in other sizes and finishes, <a href=\"/pages/contact\"><b>Contact Us</a></b> for more information.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions \"C\" Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<li>Height:12\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Holes: 10\" Center to Center</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This beautiful door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
